00:08:01.267 --> 00:08:02.601
-Yes.
-It is back.

00:08:02.601 --> 00:08:04.300
-It is back.
-And it's big.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:07.534
It's action, it is funny,
it is -- it's cool.

00:08:07.534 --> 00:08:09.067
Dude, you do everything.
-Please tell them again

00:08:09.067 --> 00:08:10.667
