hollering at me.

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:12.367
-It's back.
It's finally back.

00:08:12.367 --> 00:08:14.968
-It is back.
-"The Equalizer" is back!

00:08:14.968 --> 00:08:16.767
Stop asking.
-Don't call me...

00:08:16.767 --> 00:08:19.000
- February 19th!
-don't tweet me, don't text me.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.067
-Sunday night, CBS.
-Sunday night, CBS.

00:08:22.067 --> 00:08:24.601
8:00, 8:00.
-8:00 p.m.

00:08:24.601 --> 00:08:28.667
Watch that.
-Listen, it'll be there.

00:08:28.667 --> 00:08:30.267
People are stopping me
in the streets about this.

00:08:30.267 --> 00:08:31.400
