We will be back.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.667
"The Equalizer"
will be equalizing.

00:08:38.667 --> 00:08:40.334
-Yes, you will be equalizing.
-You know what I mean?

00:08:40.334 --> 00:08:42.167
We will be netting
some more justice.

00:08:42.167 --> 00:08:43.734
It's gonna be cool.
-Yeah.

00:08:43.734 --> 00:08:46.968
