whoever did the locations

00:09:25.133 --> 00:09:28.200
read our bio or something.
Me and Shakim were like --

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.601
We literately shot
at my high school.

00:09:30.601 --> 00:09:33.367
Like, we looked
at the call sheet and was like,

00:09:33.367 --> 00:09:35.701
"This is Irvington High School."

00:09:35.701 --> 00:09:37.634
So, we shot in the parking lot.

00:09:37.634 --> 00:09:39.934
We're at the high school
where I went to high school,

00:09:39.934 --> 00:09:42.100
where my mother taught,
where I shot

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.100
"Latifah's Had It Up to Here"
video.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.267
I mean, it is weird.
You know what I mean?

00:09:47.267 --> 00:09:50.567
We're in Brooklyn in places
where I should never be again.

00:09:50.567 --> 00:09:51.901
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:51.901 --> 00:09:53.367
-Did that.
You know what I mean?

00:09:53.367 --> 00:09:55.434
No need to do it again.
-You did that, yeah.

00:09:55.434 --> 00:09:58.601
Do you feel like someone
up there is loving you.

00:09:58.601 --> 00:10:01.934
-I really honestly have,
and it kind of gave me

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:05.033
a little bit of -- you know,
it was like a constellation.

00:10:05.033 --> 00:10:07.634
I was just following the stars
for the first two seasons,

00:10:07.634 --> 00:10:10.234
and here we are,
so thank you so much

00:10:10.234 --> 00:10:11.634
for your support
and watching the show.

00:10:11.634 --> 00:10:13.667
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's great.

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:16.133
I love it.
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:19.467
Here's Queen Latifah in a new
episode of "The Equalizer."

00:10:19.467 --> 00:10:20.934
Take a look at this.

00:10:20.934 --> 00:10:23.067
-This doesn't feel like a case.

00:10:23.067 --> 00:10:26.067
-No, actually, it's about Mel.

00:10:26.067 --> 00:10:28.033
He's been training Delilah
in self-defense,

00:10:28.033 --> 00:10:30.000
although I expressly forbade it.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.934
-Ouch.

00:10:31.934 --> 00:10:35.601
Should've put a shot of whiskey
in that coffin.

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:37.534
-I mean, she's my best friend.

00:10:37.534 --> 00:10:39.200
Hell, she's like my sister.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.367
But the fact that she would
go behind my back like that...

00:10:41.367 --> 00:10:43.968
-Feels like a betrayal.

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:48.033
-And I'm trying to move past it.

00:10:48.033 --> 00:10:50.067
-Sure you're willing to throw
that kind of friendship away

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:52.133
because of one mistake?

00:10:53.801 --> 00:10:55.634
-It's not a mistake.

00:10:55.634 --> 00:10:57.434
This is my daughter.

00:10:57.434 --> 00:10:59.901
-No doubt.
You know, a wise woman

00:10:59.901 --> 00:11:01.734
once told me
that the only person you hurt

00:11:01.734 --> 00:11:04.033
by holding a grudge is yourself.

00:11:07.067 --> 00:11:08.868
-I was talking about
your father.

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:10.300
That's different.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.868
-Come on.
Queen Latifah.

00:11:11.868 --> 00:11:13.701
That's what I'm talking about.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:13.701 --> 00:11:18.667
"The Equalizer" is back,
Sundays at 8:00 p.m., on CBS,

00:11:18.667 --> 00:11:20.701
streaming on Paramount+.

00:11:20.701 --> 00:11:23.234
And all episodes
of "Unity in the Community"

00:11:23.234 --> 00:11:25.801
are available exclusively
on Audible.

00:11:25.801 --> 00:11:28.868
Queen Latifah and I are doing
"The Whisper Challenge"

00:11:28.868 --> 00:11:31.634
after the break.
Stick around.

